<title>SOUTH KOREA: TABLE-Hankook Tire H1 net profit up.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Hankook Tire H1 net profit up.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30.</p>
<p>	 (In billions of won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				 549    vs	531</p>
<p>    Net					   3.17 vs	  3.04</p>
<p>    Profit before tax			 4.58 vs	  4.53</p>
<p>    Turnover				  529.95 vs	493.82</p>
<p>Note - Hankook Tire Manufacturing Co Ltd is one of South Korea's two producers of automotive tyres and tubes. The Korea Listed Companies Association provided the figures.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
